**`@PostConstruct`** and **`@PreDestroy`** are standardized lifecycle annotations defined by the JSR-250 / Jakarta EE specification (`jakarta.annotation.*`). They allow Spring-managed beans to execute initialization logic immediately after dependency wiring and cleanup logic immediately before container shutdown:

