**`@ComponentScan`** instructs the Spring IoC container which package hierarchies to scan in order to discover and register Spring beans annotated with stereotype annotations (`@Component`, `@Service`, `@Repository`, `@Controller`, and `@Configuration`).

In Spring Boot, `@ComponentScan` is automatically included as part of the primary `@SpringBootApplication` meta-annotation.

